@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to create a scenario for a selected map
    activate System

        System --> Editor : asks for scenario name and time period (start and end date)
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : provides scenario details
    activate System

        System --> Editor : validates time period
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : confirms scenario creation
    activate System

        System --> Editor : creates scenario and confirms success
    deactivate System

@enduml
